OL,3,AThe rise and fall and rise again of    
OL,4,AJensen Huang                           
OL,6,FIt's being called a comeback for the   
OL,7,Fages.                                  
OL,9,FFor a long time it seemed that Jensen  
OL,10,FHuang, the leather jacket-clad founder 
OL,11,Fof Nvidia, dubbed the "Taylor Swift of 
OL,12,Ftech", could do no wrong.              
OL,14,FThen came allegations of two affairs - 
OL,15,Fone with a businesswoman suspected of  
OL,16,Fbeing a Chinese spy - that rocked the  
OL,17,Fworld of tech and the global stock     
OL,18,Fmarket. Huang resigned.                
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
